(8403,'Edit the block\'s settings. The available settings vary depending on the module that provides the block, but for all blocks you can change:','','10.4.0'),
(8404,'<em>Block title</em>: The heading for the block on your site -- for some blocks, you will need to check the <em>Override title</em> checkbox in order to enter a title','','10.4.0'),
