(9881,'Migrating an Existing Text Format to CKEditor 5','','none'),
(9882,'When switching an existing text format to use CKEditor 5, an automatic process is initiated that helps text formats switching to CKEditor 5 from CKEditor 4 (or no text editor) to do so with minimal effort and zero data loss.','','none'),
