(10129,'Allows importing and exporting configuration changes.','','10.4.0'),
(10130,'Content Moderation allows you to apply <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows</a> to content, content blocks, and other <a href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module help, with background on content entities\">content entities</a>, to provide more fine-grained publishing options. For example, a Basic page might have states such as Draft and Published, with allowed transitions such as Draft to Published (making the current revision \"live\"), and Published to Draft (making a new draft revision of published content).','','none'),
(10131,'Provides additional publication states that can be used by other modules to moderate content.','','10.4.0'),
(10132,'The Content Translation module allows you to translate content, comments, content blocks, taxonomy terms, users and other <a href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module help, with background on content entities\">content entities</a>. Together with the modules <a href=\":language\">Language</a>, <a href=\":config-trans\">Configuration Translation</a>, and <a href=\":locale\">Interface Translation</a>, it allows you to build multilingual websites. For more information, see the <a href=\":translation-entity\">online documentation for the Content Translation module</a>.','','none'),
