(11282,'The Admin Toolbar module enhances the <a href=\":toolbar\">Toolbar</a> module by providing fast access to all the administrative links at the top of your site. Admin Toolbar remains a very \"lightweight\" module by closely integrating with all Toolbar functionality. It can be used in conjunction with all the sub modules included on Admin Toolbar, for quick access to system commands such as Flush all caches, <a href=\":automated_cron\">Run cron</a>, Run Updates, etc.','','none'),
