(11673,'The Pathauto module provides a mechanism to automate the creation of <a href=\"path\">path</a> aliases. This makes URLs more readable and helps search engines index content more effectively.  For more information, see the <a href=\":online\">online documentation for Pathauto</a>.','','none'),
